
<div style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div class="panel" style="padding: 28px;">
    <h3 style="font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;">Environment Configuration</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6;">
      Settings are loaded from your <code>.env</code> environment file or deployment variables. Update your <code>.env</code> file to change these values.
    </p>

    <table class="admin-table" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td style="font-weight: 600;">SITE_NAME</td>
          <td style="color: var(--accent);"><%= SITE_NAME %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="font-weight: 600;">SITE_TAGLINE</td>
          <td style="color: var(--text-muted);"><%= SITE_TAGLINE %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="font-weight: 600;">SITE_AUTHOR</td>
          <td style="color: var(--text-muted);"><%= SITE_AUTHOR %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="font-weight: 600;">ADMIN_USERNAME</td>
          <td style="color: var(--text-muted);">admin</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <h4 style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;">Deploying to Production</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
        When deploying to Railway, Render, or Fly.io, set <code>NODE_ENV=production</code>, specify your <code>SECRET_KEY</code>, <code>DATABASE_URL</code>, and <code>RESEND_API_KEY</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
